{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23706","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23706/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23706/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23706/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/23706","id":320293856,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMjAyOTM4NTY=","number":23706,"title":"[IVY][Fix] Directives matching logic results in unnecessary attributes and bindings","user":{"login":"pkozlowski-opensource","id":973550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MzU1MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/973550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource","html_url":"https://github.com/pkozlowski-opensource","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkozlowski-opensource/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones/83","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/milestone/83","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones/83/labels","id":3143880,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMzE0Mzg4MA==","number":83,"title":"needsTriage","description":"Milestone for all issues that haven't been triaged yet","creator":{"login":"ocombe","id":265378,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTM3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265378?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe","html_url":"https://github.com/ocombe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocombe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":441,"closed_issues":10002,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-02-26T14:22:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T08:40:05Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2018-05-04T14:20:55Z","updated_at":"2019-09-13T16:51:05Z","closed_at":"2018-05-30T16:57:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Problem description\r\n\r\nThe directives matching logic implemented today relies on attributes array passed to the `elementStart` instruction. This logic needs to be adjusted for cases where a directive needs to match a _binding_ instead of a static attribute.\r\n\r\nConsider a simple example of the `<span [dir]=\"false\">` template with the following directive:\r\n\r\n```\r\n@Directive({\r\n  selector: '[dir]'\r\n})\r\nclass Directive {\r\n  @Input() dir;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nGiven this example the current compiler / runtime expect `elementStart(0, 'span', ['dir', 'false']);` but this is not correct: `dir` is not a real attribute and thus:\r\n* should not be reflected in the DOM\r\n* we should not use \"false\" in [binding inputs from attributes]()\r\n\r\nHere is a simple (failing) test case that exposes both issues:  https://github.com/pkozlowski-opensource/angular/commit/06e93c697e00e4d1f4bd5462e8b4fb6d054e42fc\r\n\r\n### Solution proposal\r\n\r\nWe should separate collection of \"real\" attributes and ones derived from bindings (and used only for directives matching). We could do so be introducing a new argument to the `elementStart` / `container` instructions: given the `<span class=\"nice\" [dir]=\"exp\" #local>` we should have: \r\n`elementStart(0, 'span', ['class', 'nice'], ['dir'], ['local', ''])`\r\n\r\n### Other cases to consider\r\n\r\nSeems like Renderer2 will still reflect attributes where there is no binding: `<span dir=\"literal\">` - in this case an attribute is reflected in the DOM _and_ bound to the directive's input: https://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-nhcmpx?file=src%2Fapp%2Fapp.component.ts\r\n\r\ncc @kara @mhevery ","closed_by":{"login":"vicb","id":248818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODgxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb","html_url":"https://github.com/vicb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23706/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}